# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-player
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
.idea
# Local GI scratch / backups — never shared; giant patches and dumped state
# that have no business in the repo.
.gi-backup/
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

.codex/
.claude/
.cursor/
.vscode/

/dist
/dist-player

package-lock.json

# Diagnostic output written by the harnesses in scripts/ (screenshots, probe
# dumps, perf traces). Always regenerable by re-running the harness, so it is
# never committed. `npm run clean:artifacts` deletes it.
scripts/*.png
# Generated repro projects (scripts/lib/make*Project.mjs) — rewritten on every
# harness run, never hand-edited. The rig lives in the generator, not here.
scripts/.gi-*/
# Scratch Chrome profiles the puppeteer probes point `userDataDir` at, so two
# arms stay independent and neither takes the shared default-profile lock
# (AGENTS.md). Tens of thousands of files, none of them ours.
scripts/.chrome-*/
# GI harness screenshots + probe dumps. Same rule as scripts/*.png: always
# regenerable by re-running the probe, so it never enters history.
.gi-shots/
scripts/*.jpg
scripts/*.jpeg
scripts/*.webp
scripts/*.gif
/artifacts
# HMR quiet-mode sentinel (see vite.config.js) — a local toggle, never shared.
.no-hmr
docs/SplitRadianceCascadesPaper.pdf
PARALLEL_SESSION_PROMPT.md

# GI rig fixtures (copied HDRIs etc.)
scripts/.gi-fixtures/
